# Build context for apps/dashboard/Dockerfile.selfhost is the REPO ROOT (the
# dashboard links @rankloop/engine from ../../packages). apps/dashboard has its
# own .dockerignore, which docker no longer reads at this context — keep the two
# in sync if you edit either.
.git
**/.github
**/.claude
**/.logs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-sourcemaps
**/coverage
**/.wrangler
**/.alchemy
**/.turbo
**/.tanstack
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
